<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday ITT Corp, RightChoice Managed Care Inc and Hi-Lo Automotive Inc are unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA also is unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
